WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:03.877
"The Battle Master is escaping!" Roxy shouted.

2
00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.421
The fighters ignored her.

3
00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:08.681
Many were still angry about the fake golden asteroid.

4
00:00:08.682 --> 00:00:13.400
One alien groaned. "This was a waste of my time!"

5
00:00:13.401 --> 00:00:17.325
He looked around. "How do I get out of this place?"

6
00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:19.387
Nebulon pulled out a device.

7
00:00:19.388 --> 00:00:22.064
"Hello? Yes, it's me.

8
00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:24.544
I was captured and had to fight in a big battle.

9
00:00:24.545 --> 00:00:27.877
I was very brave! Anyway, can you pick me up?

10
00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:29.597
I'll send you my location."

11
00:00:29.598 --> 00:00:32.184
The crowd, meanwhile, was growing angrier.

12
00:00:32.185 --> 00:00:34.916
"The Galactic Battle Bonanza is a rip-off!"

13
00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:37.315
"I want my money back!"

14
00:00:37.316 --> 00:00:40.597
Cozlin shrugged. "I guess we can leave."

15
00:00:40.598 --> 00:00:43.394
Wukong tucked his iron bar into his ear.

16
00:00:43.395 --> 00:00:46.368
Roxy folded her arms. "No way.

17
00:00:46.369 --> 00:00:48.667
The Battle Master is a bad guy!

18
00:00:48.668 --> 00:00:50.812
And we're the Galaxy Squad.

19
00:00:50.813 --> 00:00:54.379
We have to make sure he's punished."

20
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.597
"That's right," Terrell said.

21
00:00:56.598 --> 00:01:00.646
Cozlin rolled her eyes. "Fine."

22
00:01:00.647 --> 00:01:06.434
They hurried through the exit and down a long corridor.

23
00:01:06.435 --> 00:01:09.877
Roxy peeked into a large room and saw the Battle Master.

24
00:01:09.878 --> 00:01:13.030
He was facing a doorway on the other side of the room.

25
00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.254
"I see him," she whispered.

26
00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:21.293
Wukong rushed in. "You can't escape us, Battle Master! We're . . ."

27
00:01:21.294 --> 00:01:24.639
Wukong looked closely at the villain. "He's not here."

28
00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.145
Everyone ran over.

29
00:01:26.146 --> 00:01:28.644
"What do you mean?" Cozlin asked.

30
00:01:28.645 --> 00:01:30.324
Wukong pointed.

31
00:01:30.325 --> 00:01:34.914
The Battle Master's helmet was open, and inside was a tiny cockpit.

32
00:01:34.915 --> 00:01:39.804
Bippo examined the Battle Master closely. "Empty, him!"

33
00:01:39.805 --> 00:01:45.020
"Hmm," Roxy said. "The Battle Master must be a small alien.

34
00:01:45.021 --> 00:01:49.005
This is a robot he uses to move around in and appear big."

35
00:01:49.006 --> 00:01:52.507
Terrell looked around. "Where is he now?"

36
00:01:52.508 --> 00:01:56.797
"I'm right here!" a deep voice thundered.

37
00:01:56.798 --> 00:02:00.364
Everyone spun around and saw a huge robot standing over them.

38
00:02:00.365 --> 00:02:02.956
A powerful arm knocked them all over.

39
00:02:02.957 --> 00:02:07.424
"Oof!" Roxy jumped back to her feet. "Who are you?"

40
00:02:07.425 --> 00:02:10.972
The robot's head popped open, revealing a tiny worm.

41
00:02:10.973 --> 00:02:15.537
"I am the Battle Master!"

42
00:02:15.538 --> 00:02:20.997
Wukong burst out laughing.

43
00:02:20.998 --> 00:02:25.858
"You're just a worm! What's your name—Wiggles?"

44
00:02:25.859 --> 00:02:27.494
The worm glared at him.

45
00:02:27.495 --> 00:02:32.833
"Don't you dare laugh at me! My name is Plurf!"

46
00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:38.299
Wukong laughed even harder.

47
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.729
"Grr!" Plurf shut the robot's head and then raised a fist.

48
00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:47.428
Ploosh! An energy beam shot toward everyone.

49
00:02:47.429 --> 00:02:51.232
They jumped out of the way, and the beam blew a hole in the wall.

50
00:02:51.233 --> 00:02:57.094
Zap! Cozlin fired a laser at the robot as Wukong leaped, swinging his iron bar.

51
00:02:57.095 --> 00:03:01.796
Bam! He left a big dent in the robot's leg. He swung again.

52
00:03:01.797 --> 00:03:06.670
Wham! Crack! The leg broke, and sparks shot out.

53
00:03:06.671 --> 00:03:11.564
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams burned a hole through the robot's chest.

54
00:03:11.565 --> 00:03:14.949
The robot stumbled back, toward the Battle Master robot.

55
00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.729
Wukong attacked it again with his iron bar.

56
00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.389
Soon the big robot stopped moving.

57
00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:24.057
Roxy flew up and pried the helmet open.

58
00:03:24.058 --> 00:03:28.629
She gasped. "Plurf isn't inside anymore!"

59
00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.991
Then she heard a door slam shut.

60
00:03:30.992 --> 00:03:32.968
Roxy looked behind the big robot.

61
00:03:32.969 --> 00:03:35.425
The Battle Master robot was gone!

62
00:03:35.426 --> 00:03:39.793
She peeked through a window in the door and saw it running.

63
00:03:39.794 --> 00:03:42.589
"Plurf is back in the Battle Master robot!"

64
00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:45.731
Roxy stomped her foot. "He's getting—"

65
00:03:45.732 --> 00:03:50.265
"Attention, everyone!" Plurf's voice came over the loudspeaker.

66
00:03:50.266 --> 00:03:57.953
"Everyone must leave the stadium at once. I'm going to blow it up!"

